      8 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِلْتَوَى</span></b> , neuter verb, <i>It twisted: wound:
bent.</i> (K, &amp;c.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِلْتَوَى عَلَيْهِ</span> <i>It</i> (an affair) <i>became difficult;</i> or <i>difficult and intricate.</i> (TA.)
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الْتَوَتْ عَلَىَّ حَاجَتِى</span> <i>My want became difficult
of attainment.</i> (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">التوى عَلَيْهِ</span> also <i>He
acted,</i> or <i>behaved, perversely towards him.</i>

